### Create reservation
POST {{host}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: Authentication={{token}}

{
  "startDate": "12/20/2022",
  "endDate": "12/25/2022",
  "placeId": "12345",
  "invoiceId": "493",
  "charge": {
    "amount": 5,
    "card": {
       "cvc": "413",
       "exp_month": 12,
       "exp_year": 2027,
       "number": "4242 4242 4242 4242"
    }
  }
}

### Get all reservations
GET {{host}}/reservations

### Get one reservation
GET {{host}}/reservations/{{id}}

### Update reservation
PATCH {{host}}/reservations/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placeId": "67890"
}

### Delete reservation
DELETE {{host}}/reservations/{{id}}
